\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Why Janine Deems it Safe Enough:
\f0\b0  The project has already completed Phase I (healthy volunteer safety trials) and early preclinical animal models. The toxicology data is locked. Janine knows the acute safety profile, the safe dosing thresholds, and the baseline cellular kinetics. She isn't injecting her daughter with a blind guess; she is using an established platform that has proven it won't instantly kill a normal human host.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Where the Risk Remains:
\f0\b0  Phase IIa is designed to test the drug in a small group of patients who actually 
\f3\i have
\f0\i0  the target pathology (in this case, genetic wasting conditions). The risk isn't that the virus is an instant poison; the risk is 
\f1\b unpredictable integration kinetics in diseased tissue
\f0\b0 . The safety profiles were mapped out on healthy cell lines. The virus's behaviour inside Sarah\'92s hyper-dividing, structurally unstable LGMD muscle cells is completely untested territory. Janine knows she is pushing the viral volume past the modeled threshold to force a permanent integration, gambling that the cellular shock won't cause localized tissue necrosis.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Why it's Ready for the Board:
\f0\b0  Reaching Phase IIa is the classic milestone for an internal corporate or state-sponsored announcement. The project has proven its "proof of concept." Hermann has definitive data showing that a single dose provides a massive, universal panacea effect that lasts for weeks before decaying. It is the perfect time to pitch the project's viability to the board to unlock massive funding for the massive Phase III production rollout, while still being months or years away from actual public availability.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

